an begin="00:23.580" end="00:23.580">, </span><span begin="00:23.580" end="00:24.060">feeling </span><span begin="00:24.060" end="00:24.270">all </span><span begin="00:24.270" end="00:24.360">the </span><span begin="00:24.360" end="00:25.740">pain</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.430" end="00:32.820"><span begin="00:29.430" end="00:29.760">Let </span><span begin="00:29.760" end="00:30.090">go </span><span begin="00:30.090" end="00:30.270">on </span><span begin="00:30.270" end="00:30.420">the </span><span begin="00:30.420" end="00:30.960">wheel</span><span begin="00:30.960" end="00:30.960">, </span><span begin="00:30.960" end="00:31.020">it</span><span begin="00:31.020" end="00:31.050">’</span><span begin="00:31.050" end="00:31.200">s </span><span begin="00:31.200" end="00:31.320">the </span><span begin="00:31.320" end="00:31.830">bullet </span><span begin="00:31.830" end="00:32.820">lane</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.180" end="00:36.540"><span begin="00:33.180" end="00:33.480">Now </span><span begin="00:33.480" end="00:33.510">I</span><span begin="00:33.510" end="00:33.540">’</span><span begin="00:33.540" end="00:33.630">m </span><span begin="00:33.630" end="00:34.110">seeing </span><span begin="00:34.110" end="00:34.590">red</span><span begin="00:34.590" end="00:34.590">, </span><span begin="00:34.590" end="00:35.070">not </span><span begin="00:35.070" end="00:35.430">thinking </span><span begin="00:35.430" end="00:36.540">straight</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.930" end="00:41.370"><span begin="00:36.930" end="00:37.470">Blurring </span><span begin="00:37.470" end="00:37.650">all </span><span begin="00:37.650" end="00:37.770">the </span><span begin="00:37.770" end="00:38.370">lines</span><span begin="00:38.370" end="00:38.370">, </span><span begin="00:38.370" end="00:38.610">you </span><span begin="00:38.610" end="00:40.140">intoxicate </span><span begin="00:40.140" end="00:41.370">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.230" end="