 </span><span begin="01:00.840" end="01:01.320">sucker </span><span begin="01:01.320" end="01:01.650">for </span><span begin="01:01.650" end="01:01.830">the </span><span begin="01:01.830" end="01:02.100">way </span><span begin="01:02.100" end="01:02.340">that </span><span begin="01:02.340" end="01:02.490">you </span><span begin="01:02.490" end="01:03.240">move </span><span begin="01:03.240" end="01:03.870">babe</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.960" end="01:07.530"><span begin="01:03.960" end="01:04.230">And </span><span begin="01:04.230" end="01:04.380">I </span><span begin="01:04.380" end="01:04.590">could </span><span begin="01:04.590" end="01:04.920">try </span><span begin="01:04.920" end="01:05.040">to </span><span begin="01:05.040" end="01:05.340">run </span><span begin="01:05.340" end="01:05.640">but </span><span begin="01:05.640" end="01:05.760">it </span><span begin="01:05.760" end="01:05.970">would </span><span begin="01:05.970" end="01:06.300">be </span><span begin="01:06.300" end="01:07.530">useless</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.560" end="01:09.360"><span begin="01:07.560" end="01:07.920">You're </span><span begin="01:07.920" end="01:08.010">to </span><span begin="01:08.010" end="01:09.360">blame</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.630" end="01:13.020"><span begin="01:09.630" end="01:09.960">Just </span><span begin="01:09.960" end="01:10.140">one </span><span begin="01:10.140" end="01:10.620">hit </span><span begin="01:10.620" end="01:10.860">you </span><span begin="01:10.860" end="01:11.010">will </span><span begin="01:11.010" end="01:11.340">know </span><span begin="01:11.340" end="01:11.490">I'll </span><span begin="01:11.490" end="01:11.940">never </span><span begin="01:11.940" end="01:12.240">be </span><span begin="01:12.240" end="01:12.390">the </span><span begin="01:12.390" end="01:13.020">same</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.170" end="01:14.970"><span begin="01:13.170" end="01:13.560">It's </span><span begin="01:13